sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student (web app)
  participant G as Gateway
  participant M as messaging
  participant DB as messaging DB
  participant O as outbox-worker
  participant N as NATS JetStream
  participant R as realtime
  actor T as Other members

  S->>G: POST /api/v1/channels/{id}/messages
  G->>M: forward with JWT
  M->>M: check membership, permissions, content
  M->>DB: one transaction: insert message + outbox record
  M-->>S: 201 Created
  O->>DB: claim next outbox record in partition order
  O->>N: publish message.sent (Nats-Msg-Id = record id)
  N->>R: deliver to realtime consumer
  R->>R: resolve recipients, attach sequence number
  R-->>T: WebSocket event message.sent
  R-->>S: WebSocket event message.sent (own copy)
